msgstr "Interwał aktualizacëji w milisekùndach"

#: main.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Only show engines associated with the parent application; maps to the X-KDE-"
"ParentApp entry in the DataEngine's .desktop file."
msgstr ""
"Pòkazëje le mòtorë zrzëszoné z nôdrzãdnëma aplikacëjama. Mapùje do wpisënkù "
"X-KDE-ParentApp w lopkù .desktop słëchającym do DataEngine. "

